"P2278580060" "You've found the relics Ashley mentioned and defeated Qelrend. Return to her for further instruction."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P893791394" "Without those relics, the Circle will not be able to command the powers to their will.<br><br>The history books of the Midnighters talk of a time when one origin commanded all the power to themselves. That one origin reigned over all others commanding any who were without like slaves. It was really a dark day.<br><br>Thank you for taking the time to go over this history with me. I hope you found some useful information out of it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
